What is a Digital Banking Super App?
A digital banking super app is an integrated mobile platform that delivers unified financial and lifestyle services within a single interface. These apps combine core banking functionalities such as account management, payments, lending, and investments with extended services including insurance, e-commerce, ride-hailing, digital wallets, investment tools, and more. By consolidating multiple services, super apps create seamless experiences that enhance user convenience and engagement while enabling cross-selling opportunities across financial and non-financial verticals.
